# VEYRA – Fashion & Accessories E-Commerce Website

A full-stack fashion and accessories e-commerce web application developed as part of my **Thiranex Full Stack Development Internship – Task 3**.

## Features

- User registration and login
- User authentication and authorization
- Product catalog
- Product categories
- Add products to cart
- Shopping cart management
- Checkout system
- Order placement
- User order history
- Admin product management
- Admin order management
- Role-based access control
- MongoDB database integration
- REST API integration
- Responsive design

## Technologies Used

### Frontend
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

### Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js

### Database
- MongoDB
- Mongoose

### Authentication
- JSON Web Token (JWT)
- bcrypt.js

